    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will appeal to all fans of economic board games . Upgrade your character, climb the career ladder - from a simple worker to an oligarch! Develop your strategy and take on the challenge in Luck City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Independent NPCs</strong> \u2014 the game features diverse characters that will make your journey to fame even more exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monopolies and districts</strong> \u2014 two key strategies for managing your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assistants</strong> \u2014 gather a team of professionals and defeat anyone who stands in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Economic battles with bots and real opponents</strong> \u2014 a variety of game modes for every challenge lover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick game</strong> \u2014 we\u2019ve made the game fast-paced so that a match doesn\u2019t drag on for over an hour. Average playtime: 10-15 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Career growth with prizes and rewards</strong> \u2014 reach new heights and earn valuable rewards.</p></li></ul>",
